      "entries": [
        "Gegnir emits a cacophonous roar from all his heads with a mystical power that distorts the listener's mind. Each non-troll creature within 100 feet must attempt a DC 42 Will save. Gegnir can't use Cacophonous Roar for 1d4 rounds."
